# race-vs2p-results: VS BATTLE 2 PLAYERS to the VS results (plan S6).
# Needs --ini debug.pads=2 --ini debug.autodrive=1. The walk is
# race-4p-vs.gdxs with both player-count DOWNs released (2P).
# Port 2 mirrors port 1 (input_bridge.c): A held + stick right
# from 3300 drives P2 into the wall until it RETIREs (~5400);
# autodrive=1 takes P1 (racer 0) over the 3 laps of MUTE CITY.
# P1 crosses the line ~9800: the WINNER card per view, then the
# VS TOTAL RANKING table with its Select Course / Quit menu
# (A at 9200..10400 walks it). 10900 DOWN (Quit), 11000 UP,
# 11100 A: Select Course, back to COURSE SELECT (mode 10).
# SHOTs hand-placed: every 300 ticks of the race, every 100
# around the finish and the result screens.
build ni-strict-census@bbd92ab
seed1 0x1234abcd
seed2 0x0fedcba9
pins renderthread=0 det=1 pads=2 autodrive=1
